ull,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-09T09:04:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T17:49:16Z","closed_at":"2026-06-28T16:25:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9400F CPU @ 2.90GHz (6 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you create an exported variable for a resource with preload set to default and clear it from the Inspector dropdown, it appears empty in the Inspector but is not empty when executed.\nAdditionally, reloading the project resets it to the default.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the MRP.\nClear the texture property of new_resource.tres from the Inspector's dropdown.\nRun the scene.\nWhen you run the scene, the texture of new_resource.tres will be displayed.\nThe texture before clearing will be displayed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[claer_preload_export_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22230036/claer_preload_export_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"airotto","id":171443091,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjgDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171443091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/airotto","html_url":"https://github.com/airotto","followers_url":"https://api.gi